PP-OCRv6 tiny text detector model
---------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2016 PaddlePaddle Authors. All Rights Reserved.

The bundled PP-OCRv6 tiny ONNX model is derived from the PaddlePaddle
PP-OCRv6_tiny_det_onnx artifact at pinned revision
2ba1506c0380b8f0b03dd142459aac66d4421f6c. It was modified with NVIDIA
ModelOpt 0.45.0 AutoCast to use FP16 internal tensors while retaining FP32 input
and output tensors. The original and derived SHA-256 identities are recorded in
the generated Depth Coordinate V2 contract and the adjacent model provenance
file. PaddlePaddle distributes the source model under the Apache License 2.0; a
copy is installed at assets/licenses/PP-OCRv6-Apache-2.0.txt.

